        <body>
            <div xml:id="d730">

                <pb facs="1166" n="1070" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg1070"/>

                <head>No. 728.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish
                        to Mr. Hall.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-11-12"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 12,
                        1873</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Ask of authorities for confirmation or denial of reported massacre and outrage
                    upon captain and crew of Virginius. Report at earliest possible moment.</p>
                <closer><signed>FISH.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
